<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n115108" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χύσις</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῠ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χέω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>shedding,
				pouring out</i> or <i>forth,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱμάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					174.6
				</span></i>
			(pl.): metaph., <i>squandering,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐσίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alciphr.
					1.21
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>diffusion,</i> e.g. of nutriment, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				6.87
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πίλησις,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Nat.Fac.</u>
				1.3
			</span></i> (pl.); coupled with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνάλυσις,
				διάλυσις,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Chrysipp.Stoic.
				2.136
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				188
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> melting, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κηροῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>P.</u>
					3.14
				</span></i>
			; <i>casting, fusing,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Str.
				16.2.25
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>dispersion,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τῇ χ. τοῦ ἑνὸς πλῆθος γίγνεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plot.
					6.6.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>liquid poured forth, flood, stream,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκχέασα γάποτον χ.,</span> of a
			libation, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				97
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόντου χ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>H.</u>
					5.78
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδατος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arat.
					393
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				4.1416
			</span></i>: metaph, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρονίη χ.</span>
			<i>lapse</i> of time, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.153
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Agath.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of dry
			things, <i>heap,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύλλων χ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					5.483
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				19.443
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νότος . . χύσιν κατεχεύατο φύλλων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Hec.</u>
					1.1.11
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.282
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Antip.Thess.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλάμης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Th.</u>
					297
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> metaph. of
				<i>fluency</i> or <i>copiousness</i> of speech, ascribed to
			Cicero in contrast to the <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕψος
			ἀπότομον</span> of Demosthenes, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ Κικέρων ἐν χύσει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Longin.
					12.4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ χ. τῶν λέξεων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Po.Herc.</u>
					1676.6
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>quantity, abundance,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σαρκῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					5.36
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Rufin.
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. φαυλότητος</span>
			<i>a great deal</i> of badness, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Abst.</u>
				3.2
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
